  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_9161.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La Polic&iacute;a Local de Onda ha cortado la tarde de este lunes al tr&aacute;fico rodado y peatonal la calle Sant Ana, entre la cale San Roque y la calle Santa Isabel, junto ala Font de Dins, tras la ca&iacute;da de cascotes del balc&oacute;n de la casa n&uacute;mero 6, presumiblemente por la lluvia. Tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n en mal estado los edificios n&uacute;mero 2 y 10.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9161.jpg\" alt=\"img_9161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9162.jpg\" alt=\"img_9162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9163.jpg\" alt=\"img_9163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9164.jpg\" alt=\"img_9164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9165.jpg\" alt=\"img_9165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9166.jpg\" alt=\"img_9166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallattransitcarrersantaanacaigudacascots/img_9167.jpg\" alt=\"img_9167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub